msgstr "復原與除錯接腳"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:181
msgid ""
"**RESET** — pull to GND to reset the board. Releasing it lets the MCU start "
"up normally."
msgstr "**RESET** — 拉至 GND 以重置開發板。釋放後 MCU 即可正常啟動。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:183
msgid ""
"**SBL** — pull to 3.3 V while powering the board to enter ROM bootloader "
"(Serial Boot Loader) mode. OpenMV IDE uses this mode to reflash the on‑board"
" bootloader."
msgstr ""
"**SBL** — 在為開發板供電的同時拉至 3.3 V，以進入 ROM bootloader（Serial Boot Loader）模式。OpenMV"
" IDE 使用此模式來重新燒錄板載 bootloader。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:187
msgid ""
"A dedicated **ARM 10‑pin SWD/JTAG** header is fitted, compatible with "
"ST‑LINK and SEGGER J‑Link adapters."
msgstr "板上配有專用的 **ARM 10 針 SWD/JTAG** 排針，與 ST‑LINK 及 SEGGER J‑Link 轉接器相容。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:192
msgid ""
"The RT1062 only exposes **SWD** debug through this connector by default. "
"Full JTAG isn't available out of the box."
msgstr "RT1062 預設僅透過此連接器引出 **SWD** 除錯功能。完整的 JTAG 並非開箱即用。"

